From a15194e9799635f050bce374330280df470120bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZjW1nd <zj_w1nd@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 18 Aug 2025 14:29:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] [Security]: Enforce NULL-checks for smb2_add_iovector.

This is a better fix for the previous 2 commit. And I also add malloc return value check in smb2_read_data to prevent Null deref.

(cherry picked from commit 883e787426df52dd19206234d7278d46ac997668)
---
